# Reset combo while a save dump is in progress, with the game writing its
# battery RAM continuously (churn): the reset must settle (flush) the save,
# toggle the loading state and come back to the running game.
expect-screen "TangCore"
press down
press down
press down
press down
press b
expect-screen "game.sms"
press down
press a
expect-overlay off
expect-core smstang
wram-burst 0x000 512 0x5A
churn on
poke-save 0x10 0x42
wait-dump
hold select+start+r 500ms
expect-overlay off
churn off
